[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8460.389, "timestamp": "02:21:00", "text": "选择，正是你选择的方式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8462.389, "timestamp": "02:21:02", "text": "就像你想要的任何东西，当然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8464.79, "timestamp": "02:21:04", "text": "对于一个你没有选择权的人来说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8466.71, "timestamp": "02:21:06", "text": "有些人。很公平。这是真的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8468.469, "timestamp": "02:21:08", "text": "不，我的意思是，有些人确实存在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8470.87, "timestamp": "02:21:10", "text": "处于那种境地的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8472.63, "timestamp": "02:21:12", "text": "在无法自主选择的地方，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8474.63, "timestamp": "02:21:14", "text": "正确的？是的。所以他们觉得他们想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8476.469, "timestamp": "02:21:16", "text": "认为有些人只是想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8479.59, "timestamp": "02:21:19", "text": "就像我看到的那样，像个恶魔。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8481.83, "timestamp": "02:21:21", "text": "你是说网络喷子吗？你是说网络喷子吗？我懂了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8485.349, "timestamp": "02:21:25", "text": "是的。有时存在的毒性"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8487.349, "timestamp": "02:21:27", "text": "简直要把你彻底摧毁。但我认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8489.59, "timestamp": "02:21:29", "text": "总的来说，我认为，呃，我认为人们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8491.51, "timestamp": "02:21:31", "text": "当他们意识到这一点时，他们正在改变，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8493.83, "timestamp": "02:21:33", "text": "我小时候，动漫可没现在这么流行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8495.59, "timestamp": "02:21:35", "text": "我当时在上学，我不能，我不能说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8498.309, "timestamp": "02:21:38", "text": "任何人，只要我看动漫，绝对不可能，绝对不可能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8500.07, "timestamp": "02:21:40", "text": "我会直接进入我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8502.87, "timestamp": "02:21:42", "text": "现在我的课上就像有这样的课"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8504.63, "timestamp": "02:21:44", "text": "现在不看动漫的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8508.55, "timestamp": "02:21:48", "text": "他们有点像我，又不像我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8510.95, "timestamp": "02:21:50", "text": "现在他们好像不被认为是正常的了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8513.83, "timestamp": "02:21:53", "text": "那是正常的，那是真的观看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8517.67, "timestamp": "02:21:57", "text": "现在动漫很正常了，你走吧。实际上，"}]